    "slope": "least-squares slope in pairs per 100 cycles, fitted over [onset, end), undefined without an onset",
    "exposure": "mean DI over [150, end) expressed in pairs -- the accumulated stock, standardised by the interval length",
    "band_entry": "cycle from which the run never again differs from its own final value by a whole pair (retrospective: uses the final value, which is where the run stopped)",
    "band_persistence": "cycles from band_entry to the end of the run",
    "remaining_trend": "value at the last cycle minus the value 100 cycles earlier, in pairs"
  },
